{
  "declaredLength": 2228,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷的警察們\n會請寶可夢協助辦案。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F776848B665BDF5011000A67038ACB5BF653EF5922535452A98FA668483002001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而目前特別引起我注意的是\n叫做怨影娃娃的寶可夢牠的特徵。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C76EE524D727952255F158D7762116CE8610F7684662F000A53EB505A60285F715A035A0376845BF653EF59227260768472795FB53002001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "據說怨影娃娃喜歡人類的\n怨恨、嫉妒這類負面的感情。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "64DA8AAA60285F715A035A03559C6B614EBA985E7684000A6028606830015AC959929019985E8CA097627684611F60C53002001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也就是說，借助怨影娃娃的力量\n就能找出累積了負面感情的人類。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F5C31662F8AAAFF0C501F52A960285F715A035A037684529B91CF000A5C3180FD627E51FA7D2F7A4D4E868CA09762611F60C576844EBA985E3002001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這說不定能幫助我們逮捕犯人，\n或將事件防範於未然。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90198AAA4E0D5B9A80FD5E6B52A962115011902E635572AF4EBAFF0C000A62165C074E8B4EF696327BC465BC672A71363002001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以呢，我希望<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳也能提供協助！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n如果<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳有帶著怨影娃娃的話，\n能否讓1隻給我呢？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE55462FF0C62115E0C671B00100003110000FF01014F6059B34E5F80FD63D04F9B535452A9FF0100100001BE01000A5982679C00100003110000FF01014F6059B367095E36845760285F715A035A0376848A71FF0C000A80FD54268B93003196BB7D6662115462FF1F001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳願意把怨影娃娃讓給我嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B39858610F628A60285F715A035A038B937D66621155CEFF1F001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "願意！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9858610FFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9084662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哦哦！\n是哪隻怨影娃娃呢？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E654E6FF01000A662F54EA96BB60285F715A035A035462FF1F001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是能借助怨影娃娃的力量，\n就能事半功倍了……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F80FD501F52A960285F715A035A037684529B91CFFF0C000A5C3180FD4E8B534A529F500D4E8620262026001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你就是怨影娃娃呀。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605C31662F60285F715A035A0354403002001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷的和平就靠你了！\n讓我見識你的力量吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F77684548C5E735C3197604F604E86FF01000A8B936211898B8B584F607684529B91CF5427FF01001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀～……好大一隻啊！\n把密阿雷的和平交給你肯定沒問題！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF5E20262026597D59274E0096BB554AFF01000A628A5BC6963F96F77684548C5E734EA47D664F6080AF5B9A6C92554F984CFF01001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "話是這麼說，\n但要駕輕就熟是需要時間的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A71662F90199EBC8AAAFF0C000A4F46898199D58F155C31719F662F970089816642959376843002001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "娃～哇。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5A03FF5E54C730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "立刻就對負面的感情有了反應嗎？\n走！我們追上去。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7ACB523B5C315C0D8CA097627684611F60C567094E8653CD61C955CEFF1F000A8D70FF01621150118FFD4E0A53BB3002001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這……這是怎麼回事？\n這裡……是我家啊！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019202620269019662F600E9EBC56DE4E8BFF1F000A901988E120262026662F62115BB6554AFF01001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "娃～哇！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5A03FF5E54C7FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你下班了嗎？\n辛苦了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F604E0B73ED4E8655CEFF1F000A8F9B82E64E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不……我還在辦案。\n妳有看到可疑的傢伙嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D202620266211908457288FA668483002000A59B36709770B523053EF7591768450A24F1955CEFF1F001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……還在工作？\n……那就祝你辦案順利了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "20262026908457285DE54F5CFF1F000A2026202690A35C31795D4F608FA66848980652294E8630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "娃～哇！！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5A03FF5E54C7FF01FF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為……\n為什麼會對她有反應？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA20262026000A70BA4EC09EBC67035C0D5979670953CD61C9FF1F001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好討厭的怨影娃娃。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n竟然對我一直壓抑著的\n醜陋的感情有反應。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D8A0E53AD768460285F715A035A03300200100001BE01000A7ADF71365C0D62114E0076F458D3629184577684000A919C964B7684611F60C5670953CD61C930020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "難道是……\n怎、怎麼會……！？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96E39053662F20262026000A600E3001600E9EBC670320262026FF01FF1F001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "她心裡怨恨著只顧著工作的我，\n但卻口是心非地表示支持……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n這樣被壓抑住的感情\n正逐漸在轉變成對我的怨恨……！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59795FC388E160286068845753EA986784575DE54F5C76846211FF0C000A4F46537B53E3662F5FC3975E57308868793A652F63012026202600100001BE01000A90196A2388AB58D362914F4F7684611F60C5000A6B6390106F3857288F498B8A62105C0D621176846028606820262026FF01001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以就讓怨影娃娃感應到了\n她這樣的負面感情啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE55C318B9360285F715A035A03611F61C952304E86000A597990196A2376848CA09762611F60C5554A3002001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "娃～哇。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5A03FF5E54C730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然說是順水推舟地在一起生活，\n但我以為我們是互相了解的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D671368AAA662F98066C3463A8821F573057284E008D77751F6D3BFF0C000A4F4662114EE570BA62115011662F4E9276F84E8689E376843002001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想不到只顧著工作的我\n一點都沒察覺她的心裡充滿著不滿。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n看來我還只是個半吊子呢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60F34E0D523053EA986784575DE54F5C76846211000A4E009EDE90FD6C925BDF89BA597976845FC388E151456EFF84574E0D6EFF300200100001BE00000A770B4F866211908453EA662F500B534A540A5B5054623002001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怨影娃娃，\n今後也要拜託你幫我了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60285F715A035A03FF0C000A4ECA5F8C4E5F898162DC8A174F605E6B62114E863002001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了不要讓她壓抑自己的感情，\n為了讓我能夠當個好的另一半，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n當你發現了什麼時，要告訴我啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E864E0D89818B93597958D3629181EA5DF17684611F60C5FF0C000A70BA4E868B93621180FD59207576500B597D768453E64E00534AFF0C00100001BE00000A75764F60767C73FE4E864EC09EBC6642FF0C8981544A8A346211554A3002001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿$",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00240000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "忍不住就是會想些討厭的事，\n連我都要討厭自己了……",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5FCD4E0D4F4F5C31662F670360F34E9B8A0E53AD76844E8BFF0C000A9023621190FD89818A0E53AD81EA5DF14E86202620260000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "娃～哇。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5A03FF5E54C730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然對不起怨影娃娃，但我會努力\n讓我的另一半不要有負面感情的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŮ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D671365C0D4E0D8D7760285F715A035A03FF0C4F466211670352AA529B000A8B936211768453E64E00534A4E0D898167098CA09762611F60C576843002001000020114016E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    }
  ],
